    "preamble": "Komalchand vs Indore Municipal Corporation on 21 September, 2023 Author: Vivek Rusia Bench: Vivek Rusia 1 In The High Court Of Madhya Pradesh At Indore Before Hon'Ble Shri Justice Vivek Rusia On The 21 st Of September, 2023 Criminal Revision No. 3587 of 2023 Between:- Komalchand S/O Shri Ghisalal Jain, Age: 78 Years, Occupation: Nothing, R/O: 24/1 Loknayak Nagar, Indore (Madhya Pradesh) (By Shri Akash Ramakant Sharma - Advocate.) And 1. Indore Municipal Corporation, Through Food Inspector, Vivek Gangrade, Indore (Madhya Pradesh) 2. State Of Madhya Pradesh, Through Collector, Moti Tabela, Indore (Madhya Pradesh) ... (Respondent No.2 By Shri Koustubh Pathak, Advocate.) This revision coming on for admission this day, th e cou following: Order Present revision is filed under Section 397 read with Section 401 of Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 (herein after referred to as the Code) challenging order dated 11.04.2023 (Annexure P/4) passed by learned Seventeenth Additional Sessions Judge, Indore, District Indore in Miscellaneous Judicial Case (Criminal) bearing registration number MJCR No.1095 of 2023, whereby the learned Sessions Judge has declined to extend period of two months time to deposit an amount of Rs.50,000/- (rupees fifty thousand) towards fine.",
